{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15872","headline":"严陵滩下寄常建 · 奚贾","name":"严陵滩下寄常建","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日入溪水静，寻真此亦难。\n乃知沧洲人，道成仍钓竿。\n漾檝乘微月，振衣生早寒。\n纷吾成独往，自速耽考盘。\n已息汉阴诮，且同濠上观。\n旷然心无涯，谁问容膝安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"奚贾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15872.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15872","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}